DESCRIPTION >
    Synthetic attribution proof only.

SCHEMA >
    `scenario` String `json:$.scenario`,
    `chunk_id` String `json:$.chunk_id`,
    `groups` Array(String) `json:$.groups[:]`,
    `metrics` Array(Array(String)) `json:$.metrics[:]`,
    `session_ids` Array(Array(String)) `json:$.session_ids[:]`,
    `sessions` Array(UInt64) `json:$.sessions[:]`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY scenario, chunk_id
